																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"690899904081428548","clan_steamid":"103582791475828452","event_name":"EXPIRATION IS OUT NOW","event_type":10,"appid":5142680,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1794349680,"rtime32_end_time":1794353401,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"The waiting is over. Now the real game begins.\",\"Das Warten hat ein Ende. Jetzt beginnt das wahre Spiel.\",\"L'attente est termin\u00e9e. Le v\u00e9ritable jeu commence maintenant.\",\"L'attesa \u00e8 finita. Ora inizia il vero gioco.\",\"\uae30\ub2e4\ub9bc\uc740 \ub05d\ub0ac\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774\uc81c \uc9c4\uc9dc \uac8c\uc784\uc774 \uc2dc\uc791\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"La espera ha terminado. Ahora empieza el verdadero juego.\",\"\u7b49\u5f85\u5df2\u7ecf\u7ed3\u675f\u3002\u771f\u6b63\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u73b0\u5728\u624d\u5f00\u59cb\u3002\",\"\u7b49\u5f85\u5df2\u7d93\u7d50\u675f\u3002\u771f\u6b63\u7684\u904a\u6232\u73fe\u5728\u624d\u958b\u59cb\u3002\",\"\u041e\u0436\u0438\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043e\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0447\u0435\u043d\u043e. \u0422\u0435\u043f\u0435\u0440\u044c \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u0449\u0430\u044f \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430.\",\"\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e23\u0e2d\u0e04\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e2a\u0e34\u0e49\u0e19\u0e2a\u0e38\u0e14\u0e25\u0e07\u0e41\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27 \u0e15\u0e2d\u0e19\u0e19\u0e35\u0e49\u0e40\u0e01\u0e21\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e41\u0e17\u0e49\u0e08\u0e23\u0e34\u0e07\u0e01\u0e33\u0e25\u0e31\u0e07\u0e40\u0e23\u0e34\u0e48\u0e21\u0e15\u0e49\u0e19\",\"\u5f85\u3064\u6642\u9593\u306f\u7d42\u308f\u3063\u305f\u3002\u4eca\u3001\u672c\u5f53\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u59cb\u307e\u308b\u3002\",\"A espera acabou. Agora come\u00e7a o verdadeiro jogo.\",\"Koniec czekania. Teraz zaczyna si\u0119 prawdziwa gra.\",\"Ventetiden er forbi. Nu begynder det virkelige spil.\",\"Het wachten is voorbij. Nu begint het echte spel.\",\"Odotus on ohi. Nyt alkaa todellinen peli.\",\"Ventetiden er over. N\u00e5 begynner det virkelige spillet.\",\"V\u00e4ntan \u00e4r \u00f6ver. Nu b\u00f6rjar det riktiga spelet.\",\"V\u00e9ge a v\u00e1rakoz\u00e1snak. Most kezd\u0151dik az igazi j\u00e1t\u00e9k.\",\"\u010cek\u00e1n\u00ed skon\u010dilo. Te\u010f za\u010d\u00edn\u00e1 skute\u010dn\u00e1 hra.\",\"A\u0219teptarea s-a \u00eencheiat. Acum \u00eencepe adev\u0103ratul joc.\",\"Bekleyi\u015f sona erdi. As\u0131l oyun \u015fimdi ba\u015fl\u0131yor.\",\"A espera acabou. Agora come\u00e7a o verdadeiro jogo.\",\"\u0427\u0430\u043a\u0430\u043d\u0435\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0438. \u0421\u0435\u0433\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u043f\u043e\u0447\u0432\u0430 \u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043d\u0441\u043a\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430.\",\"\u0397 \u03b1\u03bd\u03b1\u03bc\u03bf\u03bd\u03ae \u03c4\u03b5\u03bb\u03b5\u03af\u03c9\u03c3\u03b5. \u03a4\u03ce\u03c1\u03b1 \u03b1\u03c1\u03c7\u03af\u03b6\u03b5\u03b9 \u03c4\u03bf \u03c0\u03c1\u03b1\u03b3\u03bc\u03b1\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03cc \u03c0\u03b1\u03b9\u03c7\u03bd\u03af\u03b4\u03b9.\",\"\u0627\u0646\u062a\u0647\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0646\u062a\u0638\u0627\u0631. \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646 \u062a\u0628\u062f\u0623 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u0642\u064a\u0642\u064a\u0629.\",\"\u041e\u0447\u0456\u043a\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0441\u044f. \u0422\u0435\u043f\u0435\u0440 \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0454\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0436\u043d\u044f \u0433\u0440\u0430.\",\"La espera termin\u00f3. Ahora comienza el verdadero juego.\",\"Th\u1eddi gian ch\u1edd \u0111\u1ee3i \u0111\u00e3 k\u1ebft th\u00fac. Gi\u1edd \u0111\u00e2y tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.\",null,\"Penantian telah berakhir. Kini permainan sesungguhnya dimulai.\",\"Penantian sudah berakhir. Kini permainan sebenar bermula.\"],\"localized_summary\":[\"EXPIRATION is now available on Steam with 15% off for a limited time. Face the Doctor Dealer, survive his deadly game, and claim the cure.\",\"EXPIRATION ist jetzt auf Steam erh\u00e4ltlich \u2013 f\u00fcr kurze Zeit mit 15 % Ver\u00f6ffentlichungsrabatt. Stelle dich dem Doctor Dealer, \u00fcberlebe sein t\u00f6dliches Spiel und erk\u00e4mpfe dir die Heilung.\",\"EXPIRATION est disponible sur Steam avec 15 % de r\u00e9duction pour une dur\u00e9e limit\u00e9e. Affrontez le Doctor Dealer, survivez \u00e0 son jeu mortel et remportez le rem\u00e8de.\",\"EXPIRATION \u00e8 disponibile su Steam con uno sconto di lancio del 15% per un periodo limitato. Affronta il Doctor Dealer, sopravvivi al suo gioco mortale e conquista la cura.\",\"EXPIRATION\uc774 Steam\uc5d0 \uc815\uc2dd \ucd9c\uc2dc\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uae30\uac04 \ud55c\uc815 \ucd9c\uc2dc \ud560\uc778 15%\ub97c \ub9cc\ub098\ubcf4\uc138\uc694. Doctor Dealer\uc5d0 \ub9de\uc11c \ubaa9\uc228\uc744 \uac74 \uac8c\uc784\uc5d0\uc11c \uc0b4\uc544\ub0a8\uace0 \uce58\ub8cc\uc81c\ub97c \uc190\uc5d0 \ub123\uc73c\uc138\uc694.\",\"EXPIRATION ya est\u00e1 disponible en Steam con un 15 % de descuento de lanzamiento por tiempo limitado. Enfr\u00e9ntate al Doctor Dealer, sobrevive a su juego mortal y consigue la cura.\",\"\u300aEXPIRATION\u300b\u73b0\u5df2\u5728 Steam \u6b63\u5f0f\u53d1\u552e\uff0c\u9650\u65f6\u4eab\u53d7 15% \u9996\u53d1\u4f18\u60e0\u3002\u76f4\u9762 Doctor Dealer\uff0c\u5728\u4ed6\u7684\u81f4\u547d\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u6c42\u751f\uff0c\u593a\u53d6\u6cbb\u6108\u7684\u5e0c\u671b\u3002\",\"\u300aEXPIRATION\u300b\u73fe\u5df2\u5728 Steam \u6b63\u5f0f\u63a8\u51fa\uff0c\u9650\u6642\u4eab\u6709 15% \u9996\u767c\u512a\u60e0\u3002\u9762\u5c0d Doctor Dealer\uff0c\u5728\u4ed6\u7684\u81f4\u547d\u904a\u6232\u4e2d\u6d3b\u4e0b\u4f86\uff0c\u596a\u5f97\u6cbb\u7652\u7684\u5e0c\u671b\u3002\",\"EXPIRATION \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430 \u0432 Steam \u0441\u043e \u0441\u043a\u0438\u0434\u043a\u043e\u0439 15% \u043d\u0430 \u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f. \u0411\u0440\u043e\u0441\u044c\u0442\u0435 \u0432\u044b\u0437\u043e\u0432 Doctor Dealer, \u0432\u044b\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0432 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0441\u043c\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0435 \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043b\u0435\u043a\u0430\u0440\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e.\",\"EXPIRATION \u0e27\u0e32\u0e07\u0e08\u0e33\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22\u0e41\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27\u0e1a\u0e19 Steam \u0e1e\u0e23\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e21\u0e2a\u0e48\u0e27\u0e19\u0e25\u0e14\u0e40\u0e1b\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e31\u0e27 15% \u0e43\u0e19\u0e40\u0e27\u0e25\u0e32\u0e08\u0e33\u0e01\u0e31\u0e14 \u0e40\u0e1c\u0e0a\u0e34\u0e0d\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e49\u0e32\u0e01\u0e31\u0e1a Doctor Dealer \u0e40\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e27\u0e34\u0e15\u0e23\u0e2d\u0e14\u0e08\u0e32\u0e01\u0e40\u0e01\u0e21\u0e21\u0e23\u0e13\u0e30\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e40\u0e02\u0e32 \u0e41\u0e25\u0e30\u0e04\u0e27\u0e49\u0e32\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e17\u0e32\u0e07\u0e23\u0e31\u0e01\u0e29\u0e32\u0e43\u0e2b\u0e49\u0e44\u0e14\u0e49\",\"EXPIRATION\u304cSteam\u3067\u6b63\u5f0f\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u3002\u671f\u9593\u9650\u5b9a\u306715\uff05\u306e\u30ed\u30fc\u30f3\u30c1\u5272\u5f15\u3092\u5b9f\u65bd\u4e2d\u3002Doctor Dealer\u306b\u7acb\u3061\u5411\u304b\u3044\u3001\u547d\u61f8\u3051\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u751f\u304d\u5ef6\u3073\u3001\u6cbb\u7642\u6cd5\u3092\u624b\u306b\u5165\u308c\u3088\u3046\u3002\",\"EXPIRATION j\u00e1 est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel no Steam, com 15% de desconto de lan\u00e7amento por tempo limitado. Enfrenta o Doctor Dealer, sobrevive ao seu jogo mortal e conquista a cura.\",\"EXPIRATION jest ju\u017c dost\u0119pne na Steam z 15% zni\u017ck\u0105 premierow\u0105 przez ograniczony czas. Zmierz si\u0119 z Doctor Dealer, przetrwaj jego \u015bmierteln\u0105 gr\u0119 i zdob\u0105d\u017a lekarstwo.\",\"EXPIRATION er nu tilg\u00e6ngeligt p\u00e5 Steam med 15 % lanceringsrabat i en begr\u00e6nset periode. M\u00f8d Doctor Dealer, overlev hans d\u00f8delige spil, og f\u00e5 fat i kuren.\",\"EXPIRATION is nu verkrijgbaar op Steam, tijdelijk met 15% lanceringskorting. Neem het op tegen Doctor Dealer, overleef zijn dodelijke spel en bemachtig het geneesmiddel.\",\"EXPIRATION on nyt saatavilla Steamissa 15 %:n julkaisualennuksella rajoitetun ajan. Kohtaa Doctor Dealer, selviydy h\u00e4nen tappavasta pelist\u00e4\u00e4n ja voita parannuskeino.\",\"EXPIRATION er n\u00e5 tilgjengelig p\u00e5 Steam med 15 % lanseringsrabatt i en begrenset periode. M\u00f8t Doctor Dealer, overlev det d\u00f8delige spillet hans og vinn kuren.\",\"EXPIRATION finns nu p\u00e5 Steam med 15 % lanseringsrabatt under en begr\u00e4nsad tid. M\u00f6t Doctor Dealer, \u00f6verlev hans d\u00f6dliga spel och vinn botemedlet.\",\"Az EXPIRATION m\u00e1r el\u00e9rhet\u0151 a Steamen, korl\u00e1tozott ideig 15%-os megjelen\u00e9si kedvezm\u00e9nnyel. N\u00e9zz szembe Doctor Dealerrel, \u00e9ld t\u00fal a hal\u00e1los j\u00e1t\u00e9k\u00e1t, \u00e9s szerezd meg a gy\u00f3gym\u00f3dot.\",\"EXPIRATION je nyn\u00ed k dispozici na Steamu s \u010dasov\u011b omezenou 15% slevou k vyd\u00e1n\u00ed. Postavte se Doctor Dealerovi, p\u0159e\u017eijte jeho smrt\u00edc\u00ed hru a z\u00edskejte l\u00e9k.\",\"EXPIRATION este disponibil acum pe Steam, cu o reducere de lansare de 15% pentru o perioad\u0103 limitat\u0103. \u00cenfrunt\u0103-l pe Doctor Dealer, supravie\u021buie\u0219te jocului s\u0103u mortal \u0219i c\u00e2\u0219tig\u0103 leacul.\",\"EXPIRATION, s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 s\u00fcreli %15 \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f indirimiyle Steam'de sat\u0131\u015fa sunuldu. Doctor Dealer ile y\u00fczle\u015f, \u00f6l\u00fcmc\u00fcl oyununda hayatta kal ve tedaviyi kazan.\",\"EXPIRATION j\u00e1 est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel no Steam com 15% de desconto de lan\u00e7amento por tempo limitado. Enfrente o Doctor Dealer, sobreviva ao jogo mortal dele e conquiste a cura.\",\"EXPIRATION \u0432\u0435\u0447\u0435 \u0435 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u0430 \u0432 Steam \u0441 15% \u043e\u0442\u0441\u0442\u044a\u043f\u043a\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u0438 \u0438\u0437\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0430\u043d\u0435\u0442\u043e \u0437\u0430 \u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u043d\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435. \u0418\u0437\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u0435 \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0449\u0443 Doctor Dealer, \u043e\u0446\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0432 \u0441\u043c\u044a\u0440\u0442\u043e\u043d\u043e\u0441\u043d\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u043c\u0443 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430 \u0438 \u0441\u043f\u0435\u0447\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u043b\u0435\u043a\u0430.\",\"\u03a4\u03bf EXPIRATION \u03b5\u03af\u03bd\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c0\u03bb\u03ad\u03bf\u03bd \u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03b8\u03ad\u03c3\u03b9\u03bc\u03bf \u03c3\u03c4\u03bf Steam \u03bc\u03b5 \u03ad\u03ba\u03c0\u03c4\u03c9\u03c3\u03b7 \u03ba\u03c5\u03ba\u03bb\u03bf\u03c6\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b1\u03c2 15% \u03b3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c0\u03b5\u03c1\u03b9\u03bf\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03bc\u03ad\u03bd\u03bf \u03c7\u03c1\u03bf\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03cc \u03b4\u03b9\u03ac\u03c3\u03c4\u03b7\u03bc\u03b1. \u0391\u03bd\u03c4\u03b9\u03bc\u03b5\u03c4\u03ce\u03c0\u03b9\u03c3\u03b5 \u03c4\u03bf\u03bd Doctor Dealer, \u03b5\u03c0\u03b9\u03b2\u03af\u03c9\u03c3\u03b5 \u03b1\u03c0\u03cc \u03c4\u03bf \u03b8\u03b1\u03bd\u03ac\u03c3\u03b9\u03bc\u03bf \u03c0\u03b1\u03b9\u03c7\u03bd\u03af\u03b4\u03b9 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03ba\u03ad\u03c1\u03b4\u03b9\u03c3\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b7 \u03b8\u03b5\u03c1\u03b1\u03c0\u03b5\u03af\u03b1.\",\"\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 EXPIRATION \u0645\u062a\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646 \u0639\u0644\u0649 Steam \u0628\u062e\u0635\u0645 \u0625\u0637\u0644\u0627\u0642 15% \u0644\u0641\u062a\u0631\u0629 \u0645\u062d\u062f\u0648\u062f\u0629. \u0648\u0627\u062c\u0647 Doctor Dealer\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0646\u062c\u064f \u0645\u0646 \u0644\u0639\u0628\u062a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0645\u064a\u062a\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0627\u062d\u0635\u0644 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0644\u0627\u062c.\",\"EXPIRATION \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430 \u0432 Steam \u0437\u0456 \u0437\u043d\u0438\u0436\u043a\u043e\u044e 15% \u043d\u0430 \u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0438\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0443 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0442\u044f\u0433\u043e\u043c \u043e\u0431\u043c\u0435\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0443. \u041a\u0438\u043d\u044c\u0442\u0435 \u0432\u0438\u043a\u043b\u0438\u043a Doctor Dealer, \u0432\u0438\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0456\u0442\u044c \u0443 \u0439\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0441\u043c\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0456\u0439 \u0433\u0440\u0456 \u0442\u0430 \u0437\u0434\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0434\u044c\u0442\u0435 \u043b\u0456\u043a\u0438.\",\"EXPIRATION ya est\u00e1 disponible en Steam con un 15 % de descuento de lanzamiento por tiempo limitado. Enfrenta al Doctor Dealer, sobrevive a su juego mortal y consigue la cura.\",\"EXPIRATION hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 m\u1eb7t tr\u00ean Steam v\u1edbi \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 ra m\u1eaft 15% trong th\u1eddi gian gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n. \u0110\u1ed1i m\u1eb7t v\u1edbi Doctor Dealer, s\u1ed1ng s\u00f3t qua tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i ch\u1ebft ch\u00f3c c\u1ee7a h\u1eafn v\u00e0 gi\u00e0nh l\u1ea5y ph\u01b0\u01a1ng thu\u1ed1c ch\u1eefa tr\u1ecb.\",null,\"EXPIRATION kini tersedia di Steam dengan diskon peluncuran 15% untuk waktu terbatas. Hadapi Doctor Dealer, bertahanlah dalam permainan mematikannya, dan raih obat penyembuhnya.\",\"EXPIRATION kini tersedia di Steam dengan diskaun pelancaran 15% untuk masa terhad. Hadapi Doctor Dealer, terus hidup dalam permainan mautnya dan rebut penawar.\"],\"localized_title_image\":[\"5f72665d8b804082588ea1ac65340435f034c76d.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"aab824f8727db9a63c9772cb491559368992289d.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"690899904081428549","clanid":"46307044","posterid":"0","headline":"EXPIRATION IS OUT NOW","posttime":1794349738,"updatetime":1794349738,"body":"[p][b]The waiting is over. Now the real game begins.[\/b][\/p][p]You wake up in a silent hospital. Across the table sits the Doctor Dealer.[\/p][p]He offers you a chance to escape. The rules seem simple. At first.[\/p][p]Control your blood sugar. Manage your supplies. Survive his treatment.[\/p][p]But every decision has consequences. Every mistake has a price.[\/p][p]And the Dealer is not here to save you.[\/p][p][b]EXPIRATION is now available on Steam.[\/b][\/p][p]Experience a first-person psychological horror strategy where your greatest enemy might be your own body.[\/p][p]Learn the rules. Challenge the Dealer. Claim the cure.[\/p][p]Or become another patient who never left.[\/p][p][b]Thank you to everyone who played the Demo, shared their feedback, or followed Expiration during Steam Next Fest and Steam Scream V.[\/b] We truly appreciate your time, interest, and support throughout development.[\/p][p][b]Launch discount: 15% off for a limited time.[\/b][\/p][p][b]Welcome to the table.[\/b][\/p][p]\u2014 Forest Lake Game Studios[\/p][p]https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/5142680\/Expiration\/[\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1890460210_1794350769_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"565924824838621241","event_gid":"690899904081428548","voteupcount":0,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"565924824838621241","rtime32_last_modified":1794350769,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1794350769,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1794347901,"votes_up":0,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"562544805318611640","gidfeature2":"565924824838621241"},{"gid":"690898727962937287","clan_steamid":"103582791475828452","event_name":"Expiration Demo Has Closed \u2014 Full Release November 10","event_type":16,"appid":5142680,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1794333600,"rtime32_end_time":1794339001,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Thank you for playing the Demo! The complete Expiration experience arrives November 10, 2026.\",\"Vielen Dank f\u00fcrs Spielen der Demo! Die vollst\u00e4ndige Version von Expiration erscheint am 10. November 2026.\",\"Merci d\u2019avoir jou\u00e9 \u00e0 la d\u00e9mo ! D\u00e9couvrez l\u2019exp\u00e9rience compl\u00e8te d\u2019Expiration le 10 novembre 2026.\",\"Grazie per aver provato la demo! L\u2019esperienza completa di Expiration arriva il 10 novembre 2026.\",\"\ub370\ubaa8\ub97c \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ud574 \uc8fc\uc154\uc11c \uac10\uc0ac\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4! Expiration \uc815\uc2dd \ubc84\uc804\uc740 2026\ub144 11\uc6d4 10\uc77c \ucd9c\uc2dc\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"\u00a1Gracias por jugar a la demo! La experiencia completa de Expiration llega el 10 de noviembre de 2026.\",\"\u611f\u8c22\u4f53\u9a8c\u8bd5\u73a9\u7248\uff01\u300aExpiration\u300b\u5b8c\u6574\u7248\u5c06\u4e8e2026\u5e7411\u670810\u65e5\u6b63\u5f0f\u63a8\u51fa\u3002\",\"\u611f\u8b1d\u904a\u73a9\u8a66\u73a9\u7248\uff01\u300aExpiration\u300b\u5b8c\u6574\u7248\u5c07\u65bc2026\u5e7411\u670810\u65e5\u6b63\u5f0f\u63a8\u51fa\u3002\",\"\u0421\u043f\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0441\u044b\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043b\u0438 \u0432 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e! \u041f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f Expiration \u0432\u044b\u0439\u0434\u0435\u0442 10 \u043d\u043e\u044f\u0431\u0440\u044f 2026 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430.\",\"\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e1a\u0e04\u0e38\u0e13\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e40\u0e25\u0e48\u0e19\u0e40\u0e14\u0e42\u0e21! Expiration \u0e09\u0e1a\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e40\u0e15\u0e47\u0e21\u0e08\u0e30\u0e27\u0e32\u0e07\u0e08\u0e33\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22\u0e27\u0e31\u0e19\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48 10 \u0e1e\u0e24\u0e28\u0e08\u0e34\u0e01\u0e32\u0e22\u0e19 2026\",\"\u30c7\u30e2\u3092\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3060\u304d\u3001\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\uff01\u300eExpiration\u300f\u88fd\u54c1\u7248\u306f2026\u5e7411\u670810\u65e5\u767a\u58f2\u3067\u3059\u3002\",\"Obrigado por jogares a demo! A experi\u00eancia completa de Expiration chega a 10 de novembro de 2026.\",\"Dzi\u0119kujemy za gr\u0119 w demo! Pe\u0142na wersja Expiration uka\u017ce si\u0119 10 listopada 2026 r.\",\"Tak, fordi du spillede demoen! Den fulde udgave af Expiration udkommer 10. november 2026.\",\"Bedankt voor het spelen van de demo! De volledige versie van Expiration verschijnt op 10 november 2026.\",\"Kiitos demon pelaamisesta! Expirationin t\u00e4ysversio julkaistaan 10. marraskuuta 2026.\",\"Takk for at du pr\u00f8vde demoen! Hele Expiration lanseres 10. november 2026.\",\"Tack f\u00f6r att du spelade demon! Den fullst\u00e4ndiga versionen av Expiration sl\u00e4pps den 10 november 2026.\",\"K\u00f6sz\u00f6nj\u00fck, hogy kipr\u00f3b\u00e1ltad a dem\u00f3t! Az Expiration teljes v\u00e1ltozata 2026. november 10-\u00e9n \u00e9rkezik.\",\"D\u011bkujeme za vyzkou\u0161en\u00ed dema! Pln\u00e1 verze Expiration vyjde 10. listopadu 2026.\",\"\u00ce\u021bi mul\u021bumim c\u0103 ai jucat demo-ul! Versiunea complet\u0103 Expiration apare pe 10 noiembrie 2026.\",\"Demoyu oynad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z i\u00e7in te\u015fekk\u00fcrler! Expiration'\u0131n tam s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc 10 Kas\u0131m 2026'da geliyor.\",\"Obrigado por jogar a demo! A experi\u00eancia completa de Expiration chega em 10 de novembro de 2026.\",\"\u0411\u043b\u0430\u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0438\u043c, \u0447\u0435 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0445\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0442\u043e! \u041f\u044a\u043b\u043d\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f \u043d\u0430 Expiration \u0438\u0437\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0430 \u043d\u0430 10 \u043d\u043e\u0435\u043c\u0432\u0440\u0438 2026 \u0433.\",\"\u0395\u03c5\u03c7\u03b1\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03cd\u03bc\u03b5 \u03c0\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c0\u03b1\u03af\u03be\u03b1\u03c4\u03b5 \u03c4\u03bf demo! \u0397 \u03c0\u03bb\u03ae\u03c1\u03b7\u03c2 \u03ad\u03ba\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 Expiration \u03ba\u03c5\u03ba\u03bb\u03bf\u03c6\u03bf\u03c1\u03b5\u03af \u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03c2 10 \u039d\u03bf\u03b5\u03bc\u03b2\u03c1\u03af\u03bf\u03c5 2026.\",\"\u0634\u0643\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0644\u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0646 \u062c\u0631\u0651\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0633\u062e\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062c\u0631\u064a\u0628\u064a\u0629! \u062a\u0635\u062f\u0631 \u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 Expiration \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0627\u0645\u0644\u0629 \u0641\u064a 10 \u0646\u0648\u0641\u0645\u0628\u0631 2026.\",\"\u0414\u044f\u043a\u0443\u0454\u043c\u043e, \u0449\u043e \u0437\u0456\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043b\u0438 \u0432 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e! \u041f\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0430 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0456\u044f Expiration \u0432\u0438\u0439\u0434\u0435 10 \u043b\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430 2026 \u0440\u043e\u043a\u0443.\",\"\u00a1Gracias por jugar la demo! La experiencia completa de Expiration llega el 10 de noviembre de 2026.\",\"C\u1ea3m \u01a1n b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 ch\u01a1i b\u1ea3n demo! Expiration b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 s\u1ebd ra m\u1eaft ng\u00e0y 10\/11\/2026.\",null,\"Terima kasih sudah memainkan demo! Expiration versi lengkap hadir pada 10 November 2026.\",\"Terima kasih kerana mencuba demo! Expiration versi penuh dilancarkan pada 10 November 2026.\"],\"localized_summary\":[\"The Expiration Demo has officially ended. Thank you to everyone who joined us during Steam Next Fest and Steam Scream V! Full release November 10, 2026.\",\"Die Expiration-Demo ist beendet. Danke an alle, die beim Steam Next Fest und Steam Scream V dabei waren! Vollversion am 10. November 2026.\",\"La d\u00e9mo d\u2019Expiration est termin\u00e9e. Merci \u00e0 toutes les personnes pr\u00e9sentes au Steam Next Fest et \u00e0 Steam Scream V ! Sortie le 10 novembre 2026.\",\"La demo di Expiration \u00e8 terminata. Grazie a tutti coloro che ci hanno seguito durante lo Steam Next Fest e Steam Scream V! Uscita il 10 novembre 2026.\",\"Expiration \ub370\ubaa8\uac00 \uc885\ub8cc\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. Steam Next Fest\uc640 Steam Scream V \uae30\uac04\uc5d0 \uad00\uc2ec\uc744 \ubcf4\ub0b4\uc8fc\uc2e0 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ubd84\uaed8 \uac10\uc0ac\ub4dc\ub9bd\ub2c8\ub2e4! 2026\ub144 11\uc6d4 10\uc77c \uc815\uc2dd \ucd9c\uc2dc\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"La demo de Expiration ha terminado. \u00a1Gracias a todos los que nos acompa\u00f1asteis durante Steam Next Fest y Steam Scream V! Lanzamiento el 10 de noviembre de 2026.\",\"\u300aExpiration\u300b\u8bd5\u73a9\u7248\u73b0\u5df2\u7ed3\u675f\u3002\u611f\u8c22\u6240\u6709\u5728 Steam Next Fest \u548c Steam Scream V \u671f\u95f4\u5173\u6ce8\u548c\u4f53\u9a8c\u6e38\u620f\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\uff01\u5b8c\u6574\u7248\u5c06\u4e8e2026\u5e7411\u670810\u65e5\u53d1\u552e\u3002\",\"\u300aExpiration\u300b\u8a66\u73a9\u7248\u73fe\u5df2\u7d50\u675f\u3002\u611f\u8b1d\u6240\u6709\u5728 Steam Next Fest \u8207 Steam Scream V \u671f\u9593\u652f\u6301\u6211\u5011\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\uff01\u5b8c\u6574\u7248\u5c07\u65bc2026\u5e7411\u670810\u65e5\u63a8\u51fa\u3002\",\"\u0414\u0435\u043c\u043e Expiration \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043e. \u0421\u043f\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0435\u043c, \u043a\u0442\u043e \u0431\u044b\u043b \u0441 \u043d\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0432\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f Steam Next Fest \u0438 Steam Scream V! \u041f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f \u0432\u044b\u0439\u0434\u0435\u0442 10 \u043d\u043e\u044f\u0431\u0440\u044f 2026 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430.\",\"\u0e40\u0e14\u0e42\u0e21 Expiration \u0e2a\u0e34\u0e49\u0e19\u0e2a\u0e38\u0e14\u0e41\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27 \u0e02\u0e2d\u0e1a\u0e04\u0e38\u0e13\u0e17\u0e38\u0e01\u0e04\u0e19\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e15\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e32\u0e21\u0e40\u0e23\u0e32\u0e23\u0e30\u0e2b\u0e27\u0e48\u0e32\u0e07 Steam Next Fest \u0e41\u0e25\u0e30 Steam Scream V! \u0e40\u0e01\u0e21\u0e09\u0e1a\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e40\u0e15\u0e47\u0e21\u0e27\u0e32\u0e07\u0e08\u0e33\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22 10 \u0e1e\u0e24\u0e28\u0e08\u0e34\u0e01\u0e32\u0e22\u0e19 2026\",\"\u300eExpiration\u300f\u306e\u30c7\u30e2\u516c\u958b\u306f\u7d42\u4e86\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002Steam Next Fest\u3068Steam Scream V\u3067\u3054\u53c2\u52a0\u30fb\u3054\u6ce8\u76ee\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3044\u305f\u7686\u3055\u307e\u3001\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\uff01\u88fd\u54c1\u7248\u306f2026\u5e7411\u670810\u65e5\u767a\u58f2\u3067\u3059\u3002\",\"A demo de Expiration terminou. Obrigado a todos os que nos acompanharam no Steam Next Fest e no Steam Scream V! Lan\u00e7amento a 10 de novembro de 2026.\",\"Demo Expiration dobieg\u0142o ko\u0144ca. Dzi\u0119kujemy wszystkim uczestnikom Steam Next Fest i Steam Scream V! Premiera pe\u0142nej wersji 10 listopada 2026 r.\",\"Expiration-demoen er nu slut. Tak til alle, der fulgte med under Steam Next Fest og Steam Scream V! Det fulde spil udkommer 10. november 2026.\",\"De Expiration-demo is afgelopen. Bedankt aan iedereen die meedeed tijdens Steam Next Fest en Steam Scream V! Volledige release op 10 november 2026.\",\"Expirationin demo on p\u00e4\u00e4ttynyt. Kiitos kaikille Steam Next Festin ja Steam Scream V:n aikana mukana olleille! T\u00e4ysversio julkaistaan 10.11.2026.\",\"Expiration-demoen er n\u00e5 avsluttet. Takk til alle som var med under Steam Next Fest og Steam Scream V! Full lansering 10. november 2026.\",\"Expiration-demon \u00e4r avslutad. Tack till alla som var med under Steam Next Fest och Steam Scream V! Fullst\u00e4ndig lansering 10 november 2026.\",\"Az Expiration dem\u00f3ja lez\u00e1rult. K\u00f6sz\u00f6nj\u00fck mindenkinek, aki vel\u00fcnk tartott a Steam Next Fest \u00e9s a Steam Scream V alatt! Megjelen\u00e9s: 2026. november 10.\",\"Demo Expiration je u konce. D\u011bkujeme v\u0161em, kdo n\u00e1s sledovali b\u011bhem Steam Next Fest a Steam Scream V! Pln\u00e1 verze vych\u00e1z\u00ed 10. listopadu 2026.\",\"Demo-ul Expiration s-a \u00eencheiat. Mul\u021bumim tuturor celor care ne-au fost al\u0103turi la Steam Next Fest \u0219i Steam Scream V! Lansare pe 10 noiembrie 2026.\",\"Expiration demosu sona erdi. Steam Next Fest ve Steam Scream V boyunca bizimle olan herkese te\u015fekk\u00fcrler! Tam s\u00fcr\u00fcm 10 Kas\u0131m 2026'da \u00e7\u0131k\u0131yor.\",\"A demo de Expiration chegou ao fim. Obrigado a todos que nos acompanharam no Steam Next Fest e no Steam Scream V! Lan\u00e7amento em 10 de novembro de 2026.\",\"\u0414\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0430 Expiration \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0438. \u0411\u043b\u0430\u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0438\u043c \u043d\u0430 \u0432\u0441\u0438\u0447\u043a\u0438, \u043a\u043e\u0438\u0442\u043e \u0431\u044f\u0445\u0430 \u0441 \u043d\u0430\u0441 \u043f\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435 \u043d\u0430 Steam Next Fest \u0438 Steam Scream V! \u041f\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0438\u0435\u0440\u0430 \u043d\u0430 10 \u043d\u043e\u0435\u043c\u0432\u0440\u0438 2026 \u0433.\",\"\u03a4\u03bf demo \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 Expiration \u03bf\u03bb\u03bf\u03ba\u03bb\u03b7\u03c1\u03ce\u03b8\u03b7\u03ba\u03b5. \u0395\u03c5\u03c7\u03b1\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03cd\u03bc\u03b5 \u03cc\u03bb\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03cc\u03c3\u03bf\u03b9 \u03bc\u03b1\u03c2 \u03b1\u03ba\u03bf\u03bb\u03bf\u03cd\u03b8\u03b7\u03c3\u03b1\u03bd \u03c3\u03c4\u03bf Steam Next Fest \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c3\u03c4\u03bf Steam Scream V! \u039a\u03c5\u03ba\u03bb\u03bf\u03c6\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b1 \u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03c2 10 \u039d\u03bf\u03b5\u03bc\u03b2\u03c1\u03af\u03bf\u03c5 2026.\",\"\u0627\u0646\u062a\u0647\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0633\u062e\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062c\u0631\u064a\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0645\u0646 Expiration. \u0634\u0643\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0644\u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0646 \u062a\u0627\u0628\u0639\u0646\u0627 \u062e\u0644\u0627\u0644 Steam Next Fest \u0648Steam Scream V! \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0635\u062f\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0627\u0645\u0644 \u0641\u064a 10 \u0646\u0648\u0641\u0645\u0628\u0631 2026.\",\"\u0414\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0456\u044f Expiration \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0438\u043b\u0430 \u0440\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0443. \u0414\u044f\u043a\u0443\u0454\u043c\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0456\u043c, \u0445\u0442\u043e \u0431\u0443\u0432 \u0456\u0437 \u043d\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u043f\u0456\u0434 \u0447\u0430\u0441 Steam Next Fest \u0456 Steam Scream V! \u041f\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0440\u0435\u043b\u0456\u0437 \u2014 10 \u043b\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430 2026 \u0440\u043e\u043a\u0443.\",\"La demo de Expiration lleg\u00f3 a su fin. \u00a1Gracias a quienes nos acompa\u00f1aron durante Steam Next Fest y Steam Scream V! Lanzamiento el 10 de noviembre de 2026.\",\"B\u1ea3n demo Expiration \u0111\u00e3 k\u1ebft th\u00fac. C\u1ea3m \u01a1n t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 nh\u1eefng ai \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u1ea1i Steam Next Fest v\u00e0 Steam Scream V! Ra m\u1eaft b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 ng\u00e0y 10\/11\/2026.\",null,\"Demo Expiration telah berakhir. Terima kasih kepada semua yang ikut meramaikan Steam Next Fest dan Steam Scream V! Versi lengkap rilis 10 November 2026.\",\"Demo Expiration telah tamat. Terima kasih kepada semua yang mengikuti kami sepanjang Steam Next Fest dan Steam Scream V! Versi penuh dilancarkan 10 November 2026.\"],\"localized_title_image\":[\"26e6b1fc4822684c254e2274786d873a495dd12a.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"6b477145ee41572a9a32b0fe705da933fdbe0129.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"690898727962937288","clanid":"46307044","posterid":"0","headline":"Expiration Demo Has Closed \u2014 Full Release November 10","posttime":1793622296,"updatetime":1793622296,"body":"[p]Hello, everyone! Forest Lake here.[\/p][p]Today, November 2, marks the end of the [b]Expiration Demo[\/b].[\/p][p]After participating in Steam Next Fest and Steam Scream V, we're officially closing the Demo and shifting our full attention to the upcoming release.[\/p][p][b]Thank you to everyone who gave Expiration a try![\/b][\/p][p]Whether you explored the Tutorial, survived a few turns at the table, or simply followed the game's development, we truly appreciate your time and interest.[\/p][p]The Demo was only a small part of the complete experience. We've continued working on gameplay improvements, atmosphere, sound, visuals, and the additional content that awaits you in the full game. Development continued throughout the Demo period, and we're excited to share the results with you soon.[\/p][h3]The Full Release \u2014 November 10, 2026[\/h3][p]We're now entering the final stage of preparation.[\/p][p][b]Expiration launches on Steam on November 10, 2026[\/b], bringing the complete experience, including the full Competitive mode and the conclusion of the story.[\/p][p]If you're interested in seeing what happens next, consider adding Expiration to your Steam wishlist to receive a notification when the game launches.[\/p][p]Thank you again for being part of this journey.[\/p][p][b]The Demo has ended. The real game is just beginning.[\/b][\/p][p]See you at the table![\/p][p]\u2014 Forest Lake Game Studios[\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_768955665_1793623563_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"565924099166270992","event_gid":"690898727962937287","voteupcount":0,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"565924099166270992","rtime32_last_modified":1793623563,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793623563,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793620573,"votes_up":0,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"562544805318611640","gidfeature2":"565924099166270992"},{"gid":"711163593016476070","clan_steamid":"103582791475828452","event_name":"Expiration Demo Update \u2014 Tutorial Improvements","event_type":13,"appid":5142680,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792012740,"rtime32_end_time":1792017001,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"A smoother introduction to the table, its tools, and its rules.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"We've updated the Expiration Demo with Tutorial improvements to help new players get started. More refinements are on the way as development continues!\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"0fca5854f50a6234d24ae6f950a7b7cbe0b53572.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"09026f9b14b7236bbc8a9fd0e5bf3641901c57c6.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"711163593016476071","clanid":"46307044","posterid":"0","headline":"Expiration Demo Update \u2014 Tutorial Improvements","posttime":1792012753,"updatetime":1792012753,"body":"[p]Hello, everyone! Forest Lake here.[\/p][p]We've released a new update to the [b]Expiration Demo[\/b]![\/p][p]This update focuses primarily on the [b]Tutorial[\/b], improving how new players are introduced to the game's mechanics, tools, and rules. Our goal is to make the first steps more intuitive and comfortable without taking away the challenge of learning to survive at the table. [b]Our game is not a diabetes simulator.[\/b][\/p][p][b]A little about the Demo[\/b][\/p][p]The current Demo focuses on the Tutorial and Survival experience, with a small introduction to Competitive play.[\/p][p]Expiration is still actively evolving. We're continuing to work on its gameplay, sound effects, music, visuals, and overall atmosphere. The Demo offers an early look at the experience, and there's more to come as we approach the full release.[\/p][p]If you've already tried the Demo, you're welcome to give the updated version another look. And if you're joining us for the first time \u2014 the table is waiting.[\/p][p]Thank you to everyone who has played, followed, or shown interest in Expiration. Your feedback, suggestions, and bug reports are always welcome and help us make the game better.[\/p][p]See you at the table.[\/p][p][b]\u2014 Forest Lake[\/b][\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_487176015_1792013887_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"562544805318611641","event_gid":"711163593016476070","voteupcount":0,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"562544805318611641","rtime32_last_modified":1792013889,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792013889,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792012702,"votes_up":0,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"562544805318611640","gidfeature2":"562544805318611641"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["690899904081428549","690898727962937288"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1792012740,"event_gid":"711163593016476070","announcement_gid":"711163593016476071","clan_account_id":46307044}}};
						</script>
					

